# Python tests

`uv run pytest` file arguments are resolved from the **process working directory**, not `pyproject.toml`.

- Set the Shell `working_directory` to the repository root for every `uv run pytest`, `uv run ruff`, and `uv run python -m pytest` call.
- Do not inherit `apps/web` (or another package directory) from a previous `npm`/`npx` command.
- Prefer `uv run --directory <repo-root> pytest …` when the current directory is uncertain.
- Relative paths must look like `apps/api/tests/…`, `apps/worker/tests/…`, or `tests/integration/…`.
